  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}鼓起勇气告白\n在河边打一架！\n{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/gcs.bin_gconSelectQuestionMessage.bmd.json:14:0",
  "message_id": "GCONSELECT_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}来，你也一起？\n{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/gcs.bin_gconSelectQuestionMessage.bmd.json:15:0",
  "message_id": "GCONSELECT_005_SELECT",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}出去玩吧！\n没辙是也！\n{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/gcs.bin_gconSelectQuestionMessage.bmd.json:16:0",
  "message_id": "GCONSELECT_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}说到吃饭的搭档，就是它。\n{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/gcs.bin_gconSelectQuestionMessage.bmd.json:17:0",
  "message_id": "GCONSELECT_006_SELECT",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}大盒装牛奶\n温热的绿茶\n摩洛纳敏Ｇ\n一起吃饭的人\n{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/gcs.bin_gconSelectQuestionMessage.bmd.json:18:0",
  "message_id": "GCONSELECT_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}冰箱里塞得满满的是什么？\n{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/gcs.bin_gconSelectQuestionMessage.bmd.json:19:0",
