 {
  "key": "export_base/event/gcs.bin_gconSelectQuestionMessage.bmd.json:35:0",
  "message_id": "GCONSELECT_015_SELECT",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}在咖啡店悠闲度过\n在游乐园尽情玩耍\n在热气腾腾的大浴场练对撞\n{00}"
