  "message_id": "GCONSELECT_103_SELECT",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}长得好看却有点遗憾的人\n誓死守护弱者的骑士\n举止温和的小弟弟\n{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/gcs.bin_gconSelectQuestionMessage.bmd.json:212:0",
  "message_id": "GCONSELECT_104",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}对女孩子的期待果然是…\n{00}"
