  "message_id": "GCONSELECT_105_SELECT",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}嘴硬又毒舌，却怕寂寞\n活力十足，却爱哭鼻子\n态度温顺，身体是钢铁\n{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/gcs.bin_gconSelectQuestionMessage.bmd.json:216:0",
